          <Pad Id="vImqF1iHXDyLj7c5OPZ7Dx" Bounds="249,625,768,54" ShowValueBox="true" isIOBox="true" Value="Enable Keyboard Shortcuts (default on): the Renderer keeps F2, F5 to F7, F11 and Alt+Enter. Off: they reach the QML.">
            <p:TypeAnnotation LastCategoryFullName="Primitive" LastDependency="CoreLibBasics.vl">
              <Choice Kind="TypeFlag" Name="String" />
            </p:TypeAnnotation>
            <p:ValueBoxSettings>
              <p:fontsize p:Type="Int32">9</p:fontsize>
              <p:stringtype p:Assembly="VL.Core" p:Type="VL.Core.StringType">Comment</p:stringtype>
            </p:ValueBoxSettings>
          </Pad>
          <Pad Id="KW1jPTWYg3d3mVAbqvQaFC" Bounds="85,695,1188,170" ShowValueBox="true" isIOBox="true" Value="Notes:&#xA;- The mouse is grabbed while a button is down, so dragging outside the bar still sets Value (clamped to 0..1). A press that no input item of the file takes goes on to the Interaction handlers of the element and to the elements below.&#xA;- Focus: a press on an item that calls forceActiveFocus gives it the keys. The element counts as one widget, a press elsewhere on it keeps the focus, a click outside the element gives the focus back and the frame goes. Enter does the same: the file commits and sets the focus of the bar to false, so no key reaches it any more.&#xA;- Left and Right change Value by Step, Enter and Return fire Committed and release the focus. Keys the file does not handle go on to the parents; Esc reaches the file like any other key.&#xA;- Value (in) sends only when it changes, so the patch and the mouse do not fight over the bar. Value (out) shows the last value QML set.&#xA;- The Renderer keeps F2, F5, F6, F7 (diagnostics), F11 and Alt+Enter (fullscreen) while Enable Keyboard Shortcuts is on; switch it off and all of them reach the file.&#xA;- Hot reload during a press ends the press: the release clicks nothing. Setting the focus from the patch is not possible.">
            <p:TypeAnnotation LastCategoryFullName="Primitive" LastDependency="CoreLibBasics.vl">
              <Choice Kind="TypeFlag" Name="String" />
            </p:TypeAnnotation>
            <p:ValueBoxSettings>
              <p:fontsize p:Type="Int32">9</p:fontsize>
              <p:stringtype p:Assembly="VL.Core" p:Type="VL.Core.StringType">Comment</p:stringtype>
            </p:ValueBoxSettings>
          </Pad>
          <Pad Id="N080exyuifuL0yw3DZNwiW" Comment="Enable Keyboard Shortcuts" Bounds="202,605,35,35" ShowValueBox="true" isIOBox="true" Value="False">
            <p:TypeAnnotation LastCategoryFullName="Primitive" LastDependency="VL.CoreLib.vl">
